Step 7: Troubleshooting
The turret won’t move at all

Check servo power: SG90s need real 5V current
Check common ground (servo GND and ESP32 GND must connect)
Confirm both boards are on the same hotspot (channel match)
Stream works, but it stays 0

Increase lighting
Move closer to the camera
Reduce JPEG quality number (fewer compression artifacts):
try JPEG_QUALITY_NUM = 18
Ensure mtmn_config.min_face = 40; is set (important at QQVGA)
It tracks but jitters

Increase deadband to 10
Reduce Kp to 0.04
Increase smooth to 0.45


